What is Object Detection SDKs?
Object Detection SDKs (Software Development Kits) are comprehensive toolkits that enable developers to build, train, deploy, and optimise computer‑vision applications capable of locating and classifying objects within images or video streams. They typically bundle pre‑trained models, data‑annotation utilities, inference engines, and APIs that support multiple programming languages and hardware accelerators. Pricing models range from subscription‑based licences to usage‑based fees, allowing customers to align costs with project scale and performance requirements.
